{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026rMMRbXW9ol1794822412.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>《女神配對計劃2》昨晚（15日）播出遊樂園約會篇，節目中一眾嘉賓的互動甜蜜升溫。其中阮嘉敏（Mandy）於社交平台大方分享多張與吳旭東在遊樂園約會的幕後花絮照，兩人不僅大方互拍「醜態」，更有多張充滿情侶感的照片。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"29440542-e087-4309-9a43-827e2dfae23f.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026oopFIwYPO41794822411.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>特別是其中一張相片，阮嘉敏似乎牽著鏡頭外「攝影師」的手，並對著鏡頭回眸甜笑，絕對是滿分男友視角。阮嘉敏在帖文中感性寫道：「所有的大人都曾經是小孩，雖然只有少數人記得。偶爾繼續當個小孩，既是幸福亦應感恩願我倆永遠擁有這顆單純真誠的心」。帖文發布後，吳旭東隨即現身評論區甜蜜回應：「謝謝你在面對和我相處時可以展露這份純粹，我會好好珍惜💙」。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"d401e3e6-4605-4239-9122-f02406571a53.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026FzX6Yeayod1794822411.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"d7acf7a6-7f7c-44cc-8658-e39fa072d634.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026Nnq28TWS281794822411.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>兩人的真摯互動引來大批網民及觀眾湧入留言區，紛紛送上祝福甚至直接「催婚」，留言大呼「其實你哋幾時結婚？」及「兩位一直幸福下去吧！」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T11:18:09.112436+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":342,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T09:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T09:04:48.617117+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T11:11:33.838770+00:00","content_hash":"443d548fea369d7f4cef64518ff2e58dd581839025b4cfebbe362f75601ffc2a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T11:18:09.112436+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}